{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/7787","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"7787","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"ND3237 .M3","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"The miniature painting and painters of Persia, India and Turkey from the 8th to the 18th century  ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Martin, F. R.","id":"actor/martin-f-r","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"B. Quaritch","id":"actor/b-quaritch","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1912","begin_of_the_begin":"1912-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_of_the_end":"1912-01-01T00:00:00Z","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"From Georgia O'Keeffe's Ghost Ranch library.\nEphemera found between pl. 198-199 : Handwritten note by unknown : \"33 [Convent] Ave\".\nEphemera found between pl. 44-45 : Greeting card from [Dorothy True] : Merry Christmas / and / Happy New Year to / you both / Mr. Stieglitz what do you / mean dating me / in life that way? Anyway / I am vey proud to be photographed / by such a great man - even if it / were 90 years ago - [illegible], undated.\nEphemera found between pl. 7-8 : Greeting card from Mary C.W. [Mary Cabot Wheelwright], undated.\nEphemera found in front of book : Handwritten letter from Clara Landau, Berling Bookseller to Sir on Clara Landau, May 14, 1925.\nEphemera found in front of book : Handwritten note from Helen Parkhurst to Georgia O'Keeffe on the back of a painting, undated.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"SColl grl v. 1 : Annotation by unknown : front endpaper, p. 29, 60, [61], 66, 81, [148], [157].|SColl grl v. 2 : Annotation by unknown : front endpaper, pl. 223, [264], endpaper.|SColl grl v. 1 : Signature on front page : \"Marian Hague / 1917\".|grl copy v. 1, v. 2 : fair condition.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}